    <p class="summit-lead">One spring tune-up (cooling), one fall tune-up (heating). Filter replacement, blower and coil inspection, combustion analysis, refrigerant levels, thermostat calibration. Priority scheduling on the 8 days a year anyone in Denver urgently needs HVAC service.</p>

    <div class="summit-services">
      <article class="summit-service">
        <div class="summit-service-label">Single system</div>
        <h3>Standard plan &mdash; $229/yr</h3>
        <p>Two annual visits, 15% off parts and labor on any repair, no after-hours service charges, priority scheduling during cold snaps and heat waves.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="summit-service">
        <div class="summit-service-label">Multi-system</div>
        <h3>Full-house plan &mdash; $349/yr</h3>
        <p>Everything in standard, plus humidifier and filtration inspection, duct-leakage testing every other year, and 20% off any preventative component replacement.</p>
      </article>
